{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名中國女子在泰國曼谷，被四名綁匪綁架，她及時跳車逃走。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新京報報道，女事主被自稱導遊的人從酒店接走，上了一架黑色汽車後，手機被沒收，雙手被綑綁，她試圖反抗但被打，女事主後來見到前方有警察路障，於是高呼求救，並跳車逃生。警方隨後開槍阻截綁匪，拘捕四名泰國籍男子。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ABDUCT-1300_004.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026AJACImNEOT1787646464.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.ABDUCT-1300_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ABDUCT-1300_005.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026qHuBy09Oby1787646477.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.ABDUCT-1300_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">女事主稱原本計劃在泰國旅遊後，前往新加坡，中國駐泰國大使館指，綁匪試圖將女事主送到緬泰邊境，她目前得到妥善安置。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T08:40:18.446436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}